 "<div class=\"copied\">\n      <div class=\"cp-label\">copied, not read</div>\n      <div class=\"cp-item\">Seventy-odd short workings of the engine&#39;s own orders, taken one at a time: a pile pushed and drawn down, the place-mark stepped along, a value fetched out of a stamped thing and put back into it, an order that turns aside on a claim. Each proved alone, and true. I have them whole and I am not going to spend a pass on an engine&#39;s housekeeping when it is this close to setting something walking.</div>\n    </div>",
